<h2>Install</h2>
<p>
  Install through <a href="https://openupm.com/packages/com.hashiiiii.prefablens/">OpenUPM</a>, or add
  <code>https://github.com/hashiiiii/PrefabLens.git?path=editor#v0.12.0</code> in Unity Package Manager. See the
  <a href="https://github.com/hashiiiii/PrefabLens#unity-editor">installation steps</a>.
</p>
<p>The Release workflow updates this Git URL to the latest release. Use the current URL when upgrading a Git installation.</p>

<h2>Use it</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Open <strong>Window &gt; PrefabLens</strong>.</li>
  <li>Leave <strong>Base</strong> empty to compare the working tree against <code>HEAD</code>, or enter a branch, tag, or commit as the base.</li>
  <li>Select a changed asset to view its semantic diff. Click <strong>Refresh</strong> to run the comparison again.</li>
</ol>
<p>On first use, the package downloads its CLI from GitHub Releases. For setup and troubleshooting, see the <a href="https://github.com/hashiiiii/PrefabLens/blob/main/docs/editor.md">Editor guide</a>.</p>
